{"lines": ["¿Quieres comer o solo vienes a manosear el pan, pinche pendejo?", "Cómo preparar un sándwich.", "Agárrela firme, cabrón, que la salchicha no se va a meter sola entre los panes.", "Báñela en crema, no sea tacaño, que esa humedad es lo único que va a disfrutar, culero.", "Unte con descaro, hijo de puta, métele ritmo a esa mano que parece que le pesa.", "Aplástelo fuerte, esa mamada debe quedar más compacta que su nula inteligencia.", "Tráguelo de una vez, a ver si así se le cierra el hocico, puto de mierda."], "words": [["¿Quieres", 0.0, 0.267], ["comer", 0.325, 0.615], ["o", 0.65, 0.673], ["solo", 0.708, 0.882], ["vienes", 0.917, 1.126], ["a", 1.173, 1.196], ["manosear", 1.231, 1.544], ["el", 1.579, 1.625], ["pan,", 1.707, 1.892], ["pinche", 1.916, 2.125], ["pendejo?", 2.159, 2.752], ["Cómo", 3.032, 3.2529999999999997], ["preparar", 3.276, 3.5549999999999997], ["un", 3.601, 3.647], ["sándwich.", 3.7049999999999996, 4.274], ["Agárrela", 4.553999999999999, 5.006999999999999], ["firme,", 5.064999999999999, 5.389999999999999], ["cabrón,", 5.413999999999999, 5.970999999999999], ["que", 6.063999999999999, 6.132999999999999], ["la", 6.179999999999999, 6.225999999999999], ["salchicha", 6.272999999999999, 6.655999999999999], ["no", 6.678999999999999, 6.736999999999999], ["se", 6.771999999999999, 6.817999999999999], ["va", 6.852999999999999, 6.910999999999999], ["a", 6.933999999999999, 6.957999999999999], ["meter", 6.9929999999999986, 7.201999999999999], ["sola", 7.247999999999999, 7.433999999999999], ["entre", 7.456999999999999, 7.607999999999999], ["los", 7.630999999999999, 7.723999999999999], ["panes.", 7.793999999999999, 8.315999999999999], ["Báñela", 8.596, 8.898], ["en", 8.921, 8.968], ["crema,", 9.014, 9.280999999999999], ["no", 9.304, 9.363], ["sea", 9.397, 9.49], ["tacaño,", 9.536999999999999, 9.931], ["que", 9.955, 10.024], ["esa", 10.048, 10.152], ["humedad", 10.174999999999999, 10.442], ["es", 10.477, 10.524], ["lo", 10.581999999999999, 10.6399999999999